#!only linux
# viewtest: a whole script for some systems only.  `#!only OS...` among the first five lines runs it
# on these systems only, under build_rs.py test as under cargo jflib test (charge 13); on Windows
# the suite skips it and counts it ("skipped: #!only").  "Notiz" (#117) types what it got.
focus #117
type "linux"
expect #117 text "linux"
expect_nowarn
